Z||000000||Uaana||07-27-2000||06:56 PM||||ok only got a couple of anwsers in chat so I'll try here...<BR>I found a pair of MR2 seats and would really like to drop them in my GT. Does anyone have any experience with these? My other option is to use a set from a geo storm.. But those mr2's are sweet and I would really love to get them in.<BR>thanks in advance||||reg||1
Z||000001||286SE'S||07-27-2000||07:13 PM||||I have a pair of really clean MR2 seats that<BR>I picked up with the same idea. The adjustable lumbar is a nice feature and they are very comfortable, have really cool tiltable headrests but: <BR>As you can already see the rails on the MR2 are wierd bent to fit the cross-members of the floor of the toyota and not Fiero frendly. I put mine in the shed untill I got inspired to do something more with them. Hope someone here has the answers.<BR>Terry||||reg||1
Z||000002||Uaana||07-27-2000||07:48 PM||||286se's<BR>how close are they as far as space between the rails? possible to just swap the rails?<BR>the yard that has these also has a repair shop right next to it so I may be able to get someone to do a quick weld if needed.||||reg||5
Z||000003||Uaana||07-28-2000||01:27 AM||||O.k.<BR>I'm gonna go ahead and do this on Fri.<BR>If possible I'll take some pics and see if I can get them posted for those that are interested.||||reg||14
Z||000004||286SE'S||07-31-2000||02:55 PM||||I checked the seats and the rails are welded to the seat frames. Unlike the Fiero seats where the bolts go down into the floor, these rails bolt in at a 90 degree angle to floor frame crossmembers. They are also at the very edge of the seat bottoms and much wider than the Fiero's. Since cutting and chopping and welding are not in my experience I think I will sell these seats to an MR2 owner. <BR>Terry<BR>||||reg||13
Z||000005||fieroparts.com||07-31-2000||04:48 PM||||hi<P>I put the Firebird GTA power lumbar seats in my car over two years ago. And with NO mods<BR>to any of the tracks, just use you fiero ones they bolt right in. The lumbar is nice<BR>very nice.  My set is for both the pass and the driver seats.  I don't have any pics except<BR>for the one on my web site. the red white and blue car  <A HREF="http://www.fieroparts.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroparts.com</A>    if you very closely<BR>you will see them.  This seat is very hard to find in the junk yards but you might get lucky?<P>good luck<P>tim||||reg||10
